/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The International Institute of Professional Studies \(IIPS\), a department of Devi Ahilya University, Indore, accredited A+ Grade by NAAC with its glorious legacy of 30 years is a premier B-School in Central India. It is an institute with management and technical courses, a state-of-the-art infrastructure and facilities. A large number of renowned professors and dedicated non-teaching staff serve as a strong pillar for the institute. llPS offers five management courses including MBA-MS \(5 years\), MBA-MS \(2 years\), MBA \(Advertisement and Public Relations\), MBA \(Entrepreneurship\), B.Com. \(Hons.\), and technical courses MCA \(5 years\), M.Tech.-IT \(5 years\) and M.Tech.-CS \(5 years\).)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
