/T (At IIPS, we take pride in our rigorous selection process, which includes aptitude exams and interviews, to identify the most promising candidates for our MBA \(MS\) programs. Our students are well-groomed, committed individuals who possess the essential skills and competencies needed to succeed in today's competitive business environment. In addition to our comprehensive academic curriculum, students benefit from valuable internships and industrial training experiences in their areas of specialization. The time spent at IIPS provides an enriching experience in management, making our graduates ideal candidates for a wide range of organizations. We are honored to present our talented students to  esteemed companies and look forward to your support in their placement opportunities.)
