/E (Our two-year, full-time MBA \(Management Science\) program is meticulously designed to develop leadership qualities, business acumen and managerial competencies, with a strong emphasis on societal impact. This program focuses on "Management as Science", providing students with a deep understanding of essential management principles and practical skills. Graduates will cultivate crucial leadership, decision-making, communication, and teamwork abilities, while also fostering a commitment to societal welfare. The curriculum covers fundamental areas such as Management, Business Accounting, Financial Management, Marketing, Human Resource Management and Business Analytics. Beyond technical skills, the program instills compassion, dedication, and a sense of social responsibility, preparing students to become ethical and effective leaders. Furthermore, it equips graduates for diverse career paths in fields like Sales, Marketing, Advertising, Retail, Market Research, Banking, Insurance, Consultancy, Financial Analysis, HRD and more.)
